                  "title": "Example",
                  "type": "practical",
                  "syntax": "javascript",
                  "code": "const macro = { key: \"M1\", language: \"Python\" };\nconsole.log(macro.language);",
                  "explanation": "Reads an object property."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
